OL,3,GNEWSAAssistant head sent 'sexually
OL,4,Amotivated texts' to staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn assistant headteacher who texted two
OL,7,Fcolleagues saying he "would love to
OL,8,Fwatch them" perform a sex act has been
OL,9,Fbanned from teaching.
OL,11,FRussell Gregory, 46, was working at
OL,12,FClevedon School in north Somerset when
OL,13,Fhe sent a number of sexually motivated
OL,14,Fmessages to three members of staff in
OL,15,F2023, a Teaching Regulation Agency
OL,16,F(TRA) professional conduct panel has
OL,17,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
