OL,3,GNEWSAAssistant head sent 'sexually
OL,4,Amotivated texts' to staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FBanning him from the classroom, the
OL,7,Fpanel said Gregory had "failed to
OL,8,Fmaintain appropriate professional
OL,9,Fboundaries" and "brought the profession
OL,10,Finto disrepute".
OL,12,FFutura Learning, the multi-academy
OL,13,Ftrust which runs the school, said
OL,14,FGregory had not worked for the trust
OL,15,Fsince 2023 and "all allegations of
OL,16,Fharassment are taken seriously".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
